# user-uploaded photos (dev-only — production uploads go to Supabase
# Storage via /api/uploads). We ignore the *contents* of the folder
# (`/*`) rather than the folder itself — Git stops descending into an
# ignored *directory*, which means `!` re-include patterns inside it
# would never fire. Targeting children-only keeps the `whatsapp/`
# subfolder unblockable below.
/public/uploads/*

# Seeded bhandara photos exception: the 19 WhatsApp invites the seed
# scripts reference via /uploads/whatsapp/<slug>.jpg are curated
# assets, not runtime uploads. Committing them lets a fresh
# `npx tsx prisma/seed-whatsapp.ts` produce a site with working
# photos on any machine.
!/public/uploads/whatsapp/

# Claude Code launch config (per-developer, not project code)
.claude/

# Phase 2b photo migration logs — keep local as rollback insurance
migration-log-*.json
